window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Prince Wrath has risen.</b></p> <p><b>The Ringmaster has come to collect my debts.</b></p> <p><b>Across the Atlantic coven members are being held hostage.</b></p> <p>Oh, and I nearly <i>die</i>.</p> <p>Through it all, the Coven of Shadows and Secrets has stuck together, saved me, and shown they cared. One above all.</p> <p>Tobias, the vampire pain-in-my-butt I’m coming to like. Maybe more . . .</p> <p>Now Tobias and I are journeying to England to find the mysterious Miriam Black. The woman with answers regarding the celestial stones. The one person who might be able to help us beat Wrath.</p> <p><b>Before the coven can take action, though, Wrath makes his move, putting my friends and the whole world in unfathomable danger.</b></p>"; 
